# Where the app finds the Pack Scanner API (the FastAPI backend in ../app).
#
# Production: your deployed backend, e.g. https://pack-scanner.up.railway.app
# Dev: leave unset — the app talks to port 8000 on the same machine that serves
# the Expo dev bundle (run `uvicorn app.main:app --host 0.0.0.0 --port 8000`
# from the repo root, with COOKIE_SECURE=false since that's plain http).
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_BASE=
